              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "To securely access and manage your Wells Fargo credit card, you can log in through the standard Wells Fargo Online banking portal. \n\n### **How to Log In Safely:**\n\n1. **Go to the Official Website:**\n   Navigate directly to the official Wells Fargo homepage by typing **[wellsfargo.com](https://www.wellsfargo.com)** into your browser's address bar. \n2. **Enter Your Credentials:**\n   Locate the **Sign On** box on the homepage. Enter your **Username** and **Password**, then click **Sign On**.\n3. **Using the App:** \n   You can also download and log into the official **Wells Fargo Mobile app** on your iOS or Android device to manage your card, check balances, and make payments.\n\n---\n\n### **First-Time Users / Registering Your Card:**\nIf you have a new credit card and haven't set up online access yet, you will need to enroll:\n1. Go to the [Wells Fargo Enrollment Page](https://www.wellsfargo.com/help/online-banking/enroll-questions/).\n2. Provide your credit card number, Social Security Number (SSN) or Individual Taxpayer Identification Number (ITIN), and email address.\n3. Create your new username and password.\n\n---\n\n### **Security Tips for Your Financial Protection:**\n* **Verify the URL:** Always double-check your browser's address bar before typing in your password. Ensure it starts with **`https://`** and the domain name is exactly **`wellsfargo.com`**.\n* **Avoid Search Ad Links:** Sometimes scammers set up fake login websites that look like Wells Fargo and pay to put them at the top of search engine results. It is safest to type `wellsfargo.com` directly into your browser.\n* **Watch out for Phishing:** Wells Fargo will never send you unsolicited emails or text messages asking you to click a link to verify your password or input your card details.",
